# Frontend

`pages/`, `components/` (primitives in `components/ui/`), `hooks/`, `services/`, `store/`, `i18n/`, `routes/`. Not feature-sliced.

- Reuse `components/ui/*` before adding a primitive. Use `FormField` for inputs.
- `useTranslation` for visible text. Add keys to every locale: `apps/frontend/src/i18n/locales/{en,de,el,es,fr}/`.
- TanStack Query for server state, Zustand for client state.
- `apps/frontend/src/services/api.ts` uses `withCredentials: true` (HttpOnly cookies). Do not store tokens in `localStorage` or set `Authorization`.
- Labeled controls, keyboard access, focus management.
